branchwise by the controlled writer, so the source-sufficient lineage is still
physically present.  The controlled root may depend on eta; this is QND label
preservation, not an assertion that the full writer factors as an identity on
the eta register.

This is meaningful route progress: the formerly separate eta decoder, H1
source, positive probability germ, and readable writer can coexist in one
fixed structural candidate.

It is not yet a unique Admissibility law.  For every `0<u<=1`, the binary
effects

```text
E_0(u)=(I+uO)/2,       E_1(u)=(I-uO)/2,       O^2=I
```

produce a positive complete law and an exact lineage-preserving orthogonal
Record writer.  Different `u` have different effect spectra and different
cubic response, so they are not Kraus gauge or output-label variants.  The
Record-only terminal result is therefore `MULTI_JOIN`.

A stronger discriminator is exact only on the active orbit.  There
`S_eta^2=I32`, and requiring the action system itself to be repeatable after
